*20
	MAINDEC-12-D8CD
	 
	12-1-71
	 
	KW12A REAL TIME CLOCK
	 
	ST PROCEDURE
	SET SEL FREQ ON KW12 PANEL TO LINE FREQUENCY
	SL=200
	IF TST AD-12 FAST SAM INST SET KNOB 0 CCW AND KNOB 1 CW
	 
	8 MODE
	IO PRES
	ST LEFT SW
	 
	SW SET
	SR=0000 TST AD-12 FAST SAM
	SR=1000 SUP TST AD-12 FAST SAM
	SR=2000 SUP TYP K EACH PASS
	AR=4000 ALLOWS PROG TO REP IND
